mpt to respond, but humps can work too \u2014 look at bison and grizzlies. I can't think of a historical tail hump but that hardly forecloses on the possibility "}, "embed": {"images": [{"thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:jn6wivst2qecdf44lt2fntuv/bafkreigo2isyfa7u4dv6r5s4s23obgfqzlddtdf3firq2hdbzu7vvukjk4", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:jn6wivst2qecdf44lt2fntuv/bafkreigo2isyfa7u4dv6r5s4s23obgfqzlddtdf3firq2hdbzu7vvukjk4", "alt": ""}, {"thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:jn6wivst2qecdf44lt2fntuv/bafkreihm2f4lyk74fpuoudafmznjq5glekzyddsrup7etotqyg3vvl25qa", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:jn6wivst2qecdf44lt2fntuv/bafkreihm2f4lyk74fpuoudafmznjq5glekzyddsrup7etotqyg3vvl25qa", "alt": ""}], "$type": "app.bsky.embed.images#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 1, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-11-10T02:00:09.570Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:3ph7mooqt5acnzv53x5copif/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzwd6am5l22t", "cid": "bafyreifwi2zjohy3ashrqbrmamyywp5ny745jbxaevcfyh4oc37pkvvgzu", "author": {"did": "did:plc:3ph7mooqt5acnzv53x5copif", "handle": "palaeohammer.bsky.social", "displayName": "The Palaeontologist's Hammer", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:3ph7mooqt5acnzv53x5copif/bafkreiea26pdntsqrmcda6rmydsj5whp3c67gdj2zqfr5buf5swrfxqvam", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "all"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2024-11-13T05:59:19.282Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-11-10T01:49:02.351Z", "langs": ["en"], "reply": {"parent": {"cid": "bafyreih7zqcpog3pk6n2b2zgn6qviqfkoi6f5mtgqrf2zcirhl3ekcgpgy", "uri": "at://did:plc:3ph7mooqt5acnzv53x5copif/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzwd6alwqc2t"}, "root": {"cid": "bafyreih7zqcpog3pk6n2b2zgn6qviqfkoi6f5mtgqrf2zcirhl3ekcgpgy", "uri": "at://did:plc:3ph7mooqt5acnzv53x5copif/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzwd6alwqc2t"}}, "text": "Surely the Grizzlies are focused on RJ, but he is out of rhythm again tonight. Free throw shooting is poor again, and he's at 61% for the season. Feels like they'll need a turnaround from him to stay in this game"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-11-10T01:49:02.987Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:3ph7mooqt5acnzv53x5copif/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzwd6alwqc2t", "cid": "bafyreih7zqcpog3pk6n2b2zgn6qviqfkoi6f5mtgqrf2zcirhl3ekcgpgy", "author": {"did": "did:plc:3ph7mooqt5acnzv53x5copif", "handle": "palaeohammer.bsky.social", "displayName": "The Palaeontologist's Hammer", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:3ph7mooqt5acnzv53x5copif/bafkreiea26pdntsqrmcda6rmydsj5whp3c67gdj2zqfr5buf5swrfxqvam", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "all"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2024-11-13T05:59:19.282Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-11-10T01:49:02.350Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "Halftime Takeaways\nNo one for the Grizzlies is having a particularly great game, yet they are shooting 51/44/100 as a team. Perhaps a defensive re-commitment is in order..."}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-11-10T01:49:02.986Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:75ywphuamkbx76cq6efue5y5/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzwcwuc66c27", "cid": "bafyreidpoptyraoiebx4bs44k63ahfhsi5kvxil7jq5w3psbmuyuy3jrjy", "author": {"did": "did:plc:75ywphuamkbx76cq6efue5y5", "handle": "jlewenberg.bsky.social", "displayName": "Josh Lewenberg", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:75ywphuamkbx76cq6efue5y5/bafkreih7kszzs5gl72sg5igovpbjfglyrxgpzrq4dfzi27zy5dgx5ep3im", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "none"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt":